{'symbol': 'LRCX', 'date': '2022-05-11 16:59:00', 'title': 'LAM RESEARCH CORPORATION ANNOUNCES $5 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION AND DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'FREMONT, CALIF., MAY 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- LAM RESEARCH CORPORATION (NASDAQ: LRCX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A $5 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION AND A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.50 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK.'}